          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Forest Walker"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The sentry ignores the effects of difficult terrain from a forest environment. They can Sneak through underbrush without the need to attempt a Stealth check as long as the sentry moves no more than 5 feet at a time and isn't within 10 feet of an enemy at any point during their movement."
